notes.content:
Hello everyone, this is Bone Nail Studio, and Trainee Death Simulator will be released on November 13th,  with a 10% discount on the first release. And, since this is a product that was promised to be made during the crowdfunding period for The Yog-Sothoth's Yard, those who purchased Yog-Sothoth's Yard can get another 10% off through the bundle.

Thank you very much to everyone who tried the Demo and gave us suggestions, we will in the full version
1. Add more types of events, including historical events, investment events, betting events, exploration events and other more interesting event groups;
2. Add multiple NPCs and their corresponding side quests, the goal of the game is no longer to simply collect Souls;
3. Add more interesting Items and Oracles to make the game experience richer;
4. Add a variety of strange and lovely Endings, looking forward to your exploration;
5. Add more Death Dress-ups for you to unlock and choose.

Thank you for your support and love!
